      },
      {
        "heading": "Market Opportunity",
        "content": "Over 60 million Americans dine out weekly, generating 45 billion tipping occasions per year. The societal shift toward tip transparency (e.g., POS prompts, living wage debates) creates a massive need for an independent standard. Tipperary sits at the intersection of fintech, food tech, and social data—a $12 billion addressable market in the U.S. alone."
      },
      {
        "heading": "How It Works",
        "content": "1. **Snap & Share:** After dining, users scan their receipt; our OCR extracts the total, and they enter the tip amount. 2. **Anonymized Aggregation:** We compute the average tip percentage for that venue, normalized by party size, time, and service type. 3. **Before You Go:** Search any restaurant to see its ‘Tipperary Score’—a simple, visual average tip % plus a distribution curve. 4. **Insights:** Restaurants get dashboards on tip trends; diners get personalized tipping history."
